nts apart)."],[1261,"**`Group`** — the boxed row for field controls (`Input`, `TextArea`, `Button variant=\"control\"`). Layout defaults only; Field injects chrome via `GroupContext`. Size is `size=\"sm\" | \"md\"`."],[1258,"**`Header`** — the top region: title area and optional trailing close (a `<header>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[497,"**`icon.content`**: Overrides the BentoIllustration component - affects SVG transformations (rotate, flip), accessibility attributes (`role`, `focusable`, `aria-labelledby`), viewBox calculations, and final SVG element rendering"],[496,"**`icon`**: Overrides the entire BentoIcon component - affects icon loading, caching, sprite/SVG mode switching, data attributes, and the overall icon wrapper"],[504,"**`ondemand(loader)`**: Register an asynchronous icon loader (returns unregister function)"],[505,"**`parser(svgString)`**: Parse SVG strings into React elements"],[1159,"**`SelectItem` options.** Select renders the label, trigger, messages, and popover listbox around them."],[503,"**`set(icons)`**: Synchronously add icons to the store"],[1160,"**A composed interior.** Pass Antares components (`Label`, `Group`, `Button`, `SelectValue`, `Popover`,\n`Content`, `ListBox`, `Text`, `FieldError`) and Select renders them as-is instead of its default layout.\n`SelectValue` displays the current selection inside a `Button variant=\"trigger\"`."],[1161,"**A function returning that interior.** Use this when the interior needs the Select state: it receives\n`isOpen`, `isInvalid`, and the rest of the render props."],[942,"**A step isn't clickable:** it has no `onPress`, so it's inert by design. Add `onPress` to make it interactive."],[484,"**Accessibility ready**: Built-in support for screen readers and keyboard navigation"],[1572,"**Accessibility ready**: Keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and semantic HTML"],[489,"**Accessibility**: `aria-label`, `aria-describedby`, `role`, `title`"],[1264,"**Adopted** — placed inside a parent that provides its context (`ContentContext`, `HeaderContext`, `FooterContext`, `ButtonGroupContext`), it picks up that parent's styling and spacing automatically. Merge precedence is defaults \\< parent context \\< consumer props (`className` concatenates, handlers chain), via React Aria's `useContextProps`."],[1385,"**Adornments**: Optional `leadingText` and `trailingText` for fixed text before or after the input (e.g. `$`, `.00`, `px`)"],[988,"**Arrow Down/Right**: Move to next radio button"],[1459,"**Arrow Left / Right**"],[1113,"**Arrow Left/Right**: Move to next/previous segment"],[698,"**Arrow Right/Left**: open/close a submenu"],[766,"**Arrow Up** / **Arrow Down** (or **Up** / **Down**): increase or decrease by `step`"],[697,"**Arrow Up/Down**: move between items; **Home/End**: first/last"],[989,"**Arrow Up/Left**: Move to previous radio button"],[1588,"**Auto-sizing**: Uses VisX's `useParentSize` hook to adapt to container width"],[481,"**Automatic caching**: Once loaded, icons are cached for optimal performance"],[536,"**Automatic Caching**: Once loaded, the icon is cached in memory to avoid subsequent network requests"],[1584,"**Bar padding** (multi-series): 4px between bars within a group"],[1583,"**Bar width**: 12px (1.5 grid units)"],[486,"**Bento integration**: Extends Bento Icon with additional Antares-specific features"],[1586,"**Border radius**: 8px on all bars"],[1483,"**Center** — when the group acts as a prominent toggle affecting an entire section or page."],[1725,"**Chart container:** `data-width`, `data-height`, `data-x-labels`, `data-y-labels`, `data-x-labels-vertical`, `data-x-baseline`, `data-y-baseline`, `data-x-tick-marks`, `data-y-tick-marks`"],[560,"**Check browser console**: Look for network errors"],[1622,"**Check container**: Ensure the chart container is not transformed or positioned in a complex layout"],[1617,"**Check data**: Ensure `series` array has data and `xAccessor`/`yAccessor` return valid values"],[1619,"**Check dimensions**: Ensure container has non-zero width and height"],[1618,"**Check domains**: Verify `yDomain` (if set) includes your data values"],[558,"**Check icon name**: Ensure the icon exists in the CDN"],[1621,"**Check scroll position**: The component accounts for horizontal scroll automatically"],[234,"**Checkbox:** `data-selected`, `data-indeterminate`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[233,"**CheckboxGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[544,"**Client-Side Hydration**: The sprite sheet is generated and injected after hydration, causing a brief paint event"],[483,"**Color inheritance**: Uses `currentColor` by default for seamless theme integration"],[1142,"**Composable interior**: Replace the default layout with Antares components, or with a function when the interior needs the Select state"],[651,"**Composes into other components**: `Select` uses `ListBox` internally; reach for `ListBox` directly when you need an inline list rather than a popover dropdown."],[1389,"**Composition**: For custom interiors (leading/trailing controls, icons, nested Select), pass `children` and compose `Label`, `Group`, `Input`, `Button`, and `Select`"],[755,"**Composition**: To customize the interior (for example text steppers instead of `-` and `+` icons), pass `children` and compose `Label`, `Group`, `Input`, and `Button`"],[555,"**Consider preloading** frequently used icons to reduce loading delays"],[649,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` for controlled state, or `defaultSelectedKeys` for uncontrolled."],[1144,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1386,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1761,"**Custom Components:** When using `as={MyComponent}`, Box accepts that component's props. 